:{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}},"x-filterable":["kind","memberId","dogId","authorAccountId","unread"],"x-filter-operators":{},"x-sortable":["activityAt"],"x-fields":["id","kind","taskId","dogId","dogName","levelCode","memberId","memberName","authorName","authorRole","authorGender","textExcerpt","createdAt","completedAt","activityAt","unread"],"x-columns":[{"key":"memberName","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"dogName","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"levelCode","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"activityAt","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"authorName","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"textExcerpt","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"createdAt","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"completedAt","defaultVisible":true}],"x-exportable":false}},"/api/v1/followup/unread-count":{"get":{"tags":["clubs.followup"],"summary":"followupUnreadCount","description":"Roles: INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN (MEMBER → 403; impersonation → IMPERSONATION_DENIED). Menu counter «Seguiment alumnes» of the caller (refetched on focus and every 60 s): the caller's unread D14 rows, the same count as GET /dashboard/counters.followUpUnread (S14 R-14-08). Requires TASKS (MODULE_DISABLED). Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"followupUnreadCount","responses":{"200":{"description":"FollowupUnreadCount","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FollowupUnreadCount"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Entity","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/followup/filter-values":{"get":{"tags":["clubs.followup"],"summary":"followupFilterValues","description":"Roles: INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN (MEMBER → 403; impersonation → IMPERSONATION_DENIED). CONVENCIONS_API §4 for D14's universal filter (S10 §6, E75): the top 50 values of field (one of GET /followup's x-filterable fields; any other is INVALID_FILTER), each with its count over the whole set that filter and q select, never one page; the filters on field itself are left out. unread is the caller's own (R-10-13: read marks are per account), so two instructors get different counts. Labels: the member's full name, the dog's name and the author's name (as their newest row stores it); kind and unread their values, as is an id whose record is gone. q narrows the set as the list's search does. Requires TASKS (MODULE_DISABLED). Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"followupFilterValues","parameters":[{"name":"field","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"q","in":"query","desc